OL,3,GNEWSAAdult social care improving,
OL,4,Awatchdog says
OL,5,
OL,6,FAdult social care in a Merseyside
OL,7,Fborough remains in need of improvement
OL,8,Fdespite having its rating upgraded by
OL,9,Finspectors.
OL,11,FThe department at Wirral Council has
OL,12,Fbeen graded "good", up from "requires
OL,13,Fimprovement".
OL,15,FBut inspectors from the Care Quality
OL,16,FCommission (CQC) said it was still
OL,17,Fdifficult for people with disabilities
OL,18,For who struggled with English to access
OL,19,Finformation, and that the council did
OL,20,Fnot leave enough time to make sure
OL,21,Fplans were in place for people moving
OL,22,Ffrom child to adult social care.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,406,400,260,160,0,100
