OL,3,GNEWSAAdult social care improving,
OL,4,Awatchdog says
OL,5,
OL,6,FWirral Council's director for adults,
OL,7,Fhealth and strategic commissioning,
OL,8,FSayyed Osman, said the good rating
OL,9,Freflected "years of hard work" but that
OL,10,Fthe council was "not complacent".
